{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HabiroZetaFamily","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HabiroZetaFamily","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HabiroBracketFamily"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.bracketZetaFamily_zeta8","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.bracketZetaFamily_zeta8","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L89-L93","doc":"The inhabitant's ζ₈ fibre is `√2` — the Q_β witness point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.bracketZetaFamily_zeta4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.bracketZetaFamily_zeta4","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L82-L87","doc":"The inhabitant's ζ₄ fibre is the monodromy-point modular zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.bracketZetaFamily","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.bracketZetaFamily","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L77-L80","doc":"**The inhabitant**: the categorical bracket as a ζ-family. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.conj_fixed_of_bar_fixed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.conj_fixed_of_bar_fixed","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L68-L75","doc":"Bar-fixed values at bar-fixed fibres are real: if the family value\nat a unit-circle point equals its value at the inverse point, the value\nis fixed by conjugation. Concrete form of the fibre-reality check used\non the binding-tail data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.bar_edge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.bar_edge","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L58-L66","doc":"**The bar edge at every unit-circle fibre**: on `|z| = 1`\nconjugation is the bar involution `q ↦ q⁻¹`, so conjugation\nequivariance forces `F(z⁻¹) = conj (F z)` — the family-level form of\nthe ζ₄ bar edge realized by `rho_compat` for the τ-assignment. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.conj_equivariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.conj_equivariant","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.toFun","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.toFun","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.ZetaFamily","kind":"structure","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HabiroZetaFamily.lean#L50-L56","doc":"A ζ-indexed family, archimedean layer: a global function on `ℂ`\ncarrying the conjugation-Galois equivariance law — the one Galois edge\nvisible to `ℂ`-analysis. ","signatureChunk":0}]}